ntastic. The parts you posted sound like the entire damn God-Machine Chronicle in a non-TRPG form! I\u2019ll have to look it up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm glad you liked it. I wasn't sure about posting it here. Maybe I should make a new thread where the lore can be posted?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T15:29:01-07:00","id":1230110,"title":"","content":"So, this is an article link, but it has a bunch of images and google map embeds that are relevant:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://99percentinvisible.org/article/ghost-lanes-angled-scarchitecture-reveals-historic-urban-roads-railways/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://99percentinvisible.org/article/ghost-lanes-angled-scarchitecture-reveals-historic-urban-roads-railways/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://99percentinvisible.org/article/ghost-lanes-angled-scarchitecture-reveals-historic-urban-roads-railways/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://99percentinvisible.org/article/ghost-lanes-angled-scarchitecture-reveals-historic